/*
========================================================
              HEALSECURE AI
             ARDUINO UNO MASTER
========================================================

GSR                -> A0
GAS SENSOR A0      -> A1

74HC08:
D2 -> Pin 1
D3 -> Pin 2
D4 <- Pin 3

RED LED            -> D7
SERVO SIGNAL       -> D6

I2C:
SDA -> A4
SCL -> A5

LCD ADDRESS        -> 0x27
RGB ADDRESS        -> 0x29

SERIAL COMMANDS:

0 = LOW
1 = GENTAMICIN
2 = VANCOMYCIN
3 = CEFOTAXIME
4 = FENTANYL
5 = CAFFEINE
6 = FUROSEMIDE
7 = GENT + VANCO
8 = GENT + FURO
9 = VANCO + FURO
T = TRIPLE ANTIBIOTIC
F = FENTANYL + CAFFEINE
A = AUTO
V = LIVE
? = MENU

========================================================
IMPORTANT
========================================================

The drug-mode SpO2, HR, temperature, pH and RR values
are demonstration values only.

Your current physical sensors do NOT measure those
clinical parameters.

LIVE mode uses your real GSR + GAS + RGB sensors.

========================================================
*/


